  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele mu bungi buabo, bakadi ku mutu kua nsubu ya batatuʼabo, ne tupitene tua bantu tshinunu ne tua bantu lukama, ne bakokeshi bakadi bakuatshila mukelenge wabo mudimu mu milongo yonso ya mu ngondo ne ngondo ya mu ngondo yonso ya mu tshidimu, mu tshisumbu ne tshisumbu muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yashobama, muana wa Zabediele, wakadi ku mutu kua tshisumbu tshia ngondo wa kumudilu; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakadi umue wa bana ba Pelese, wakadi ku mutu kua tupitene tuonso tua mu ngondo wa kumudilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dodai, Muena Ahoa, wakadi ku mutu kua tshisumbu tshia mu ngondo muibidi; Mikelota wakadi ku mutu kuabo; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya, muana wa Yehoyada muakuidi, wakadi ku mutu kua tshisumbu tshia mu ngondo muisatu; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya eu wakadi umue wa bantu aba bakole makumi asatu, wakadi ku mutu kuabo mene; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi muanʼandi Amizabada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asahele, muanʼabo ne Yoaba, wakadi kapitene ka mu ngondo muinai; Zebadaya muanʼandi wakamulonda ku nyima; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shamehuta, Muena Yisela, wakadi kapitene ka tshisumbu tshia mu ngondo muitanu; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ila, muana wa Ikeshe, Muena Tekoa, wakadi kapitene ka tshisumbu tshia mu ngondo muisambombo; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helese, Muena Pelona wa bana ba Efelayima, wakadi kapitene ka tshisumbu tshia mu ngondo wa muanda mutekete; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibekai, Muena Husha wa Bena Zela, wakadi kapitene ka tshisumbu tshia mu ngondo wa muanda mukulu; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiezê, Muena Anatota wa Bena Benyamina, wakadi kapitene ka tshisumbu tshia mu ngondo wa tshitema; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mehalai, Muena Netofa wa Bena Zela, wakadi kapitene ka tshisumbu tshia mu ngondo wa dikumi; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya, Muena Pilatona wa Bena Efelayima, wakadi kapitene ka mu tshisumbu tshia mu ngondo wa dikumi ne umue; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heledai, Muena Netofa wa Oteniele, wakadi kapitene ka tshisumbu tshia mu ngondo wa dikumi ne muibidi; mu tshisumbu tshiandi muakadi bantu binunu makumi abidi ne binai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tupitene tua bisamba bia Bena Isalele: Eliezê, muana wa Zikeli, wakadi ku mutu kua Bena Lubena; Shefataya, muana wa Mâka, wakadi ku mutu kua Bena Shimeona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashabeya, muana wa Kemuele, wakadi ku mutu kua Bena Lewi; Sadoka wakadi ku mutu kua bana ba Alona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elihu, muanʼabo ne Davidi, wakadi ku mutu kua Bena Yuda; Omeli, muana wa Mikaele, wakadi ku mutu kua Bena Yisakâ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yishemaya, muana wa Obadaya, wakadi ku mutu kua Bena Zebuluna; Yelemota, muana wa Azazele, wakadi ku mutu kua Bena Nafatale; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoshea, muana wa Azazaya, wakadi ku mutu kua Bena Efelayima; Yoele, muana wa Pedaya, wakadi ku mutu kua tshituha tshia Bena Manashe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido, muana wa Zekâya, wakadi ku mutu kua tshituha tshia Bena Manashe ba mu Gilada; Yâsiele, muana wa Abinê, wakadi ku mutu kua Bena Benyamina; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azalele, muana wa Yelohama, wakadi ku mutu kua Bena Dana. Etu ntupitene tua bisamba bia Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Davidi kakabala bantu bakadi kabayi bakumbane bidimu makumi abidi; bualu bua Yehowa wakabalaya ne, Nenkumbashe Bena Isalele bu mitoto ya mu diulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoaba, muana wa Seluya, wakabanga kutubala, kadi yeye kakashikisha mudimu eu; tshiji tshia Yehowa tshiakahatukila Bena Isalele bua bualu ebu; kabakafunda bungi buabo mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a mukelenge Davidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azemaweta, muana wa Adiele, wakadi ku mutu kua bibutshilu bia mukelenge; Yonatana, muana wa Uziya, wakadi ku mutu kua bibutshilu bia mu madimi ne bia mu bimenga ne bia mu misoko mikese ne bia mu nsubu ya mukelenge; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezeli, muana wa Keluba, wakadi ku mutu kua mudimu wonso wa madimi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimei, Muena Lamata, wakadi ku mutu kua madimi a tumuma tukese; Zabedi, Muena Shefemi, wakadi ku mutu kua bintu biakakumbana mu madimi a tumuma tukese biakatekabo mu bitekelu bia nvinyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bâla-hanana, Muena Gedê, wakadi ku mutu kua mitshi ya diye ne ya sycomore ya mu bibanda; Yoasha wakadi ku mutu kua bitekelu bia manyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shitelai, Muena Shalona, wakadi ku mutu kua bimuna biakadishabo mu Sifiona; Shafata, muana wa Adelai, wakadi ku mutu kua bimuna bia mu bibanda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obila, Muena Yishemaele, wakadi ku mutu kua tumelo; Yedeya, Muena Melonita, wakadi ku mutu kua nyama ya mpunda; Yaziza, Muena Hageli, wakadi ku mutu kua mikoko. ",
